      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "msfrpc outranks ssh for offensive types REGARDLESS of registration order\n(the sort key, not list order, decides). No supporting channel -> empty decision.\nchannel_router() is the Executor's default (lazy-imported in base.py).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el1075",
      "originalText": "msfrpc outranks ssh for offensive types REGARDLESS of registration order\n(the sort key, not list order, decides). No supporting channel -> empty decision.\nchannel_router() is the Executor's default (lazy-imported in base.py).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    }
